      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is valid and refusing to separate reality from healing, even when it hurts. Sometimes letting things go and feeling the breaking is the only honest way to honor what was lost rather than pretending the wreckage is gone. Even in the aftermath, your capacity to feel this deeply still means there is something precious left behind to carry through to the next sunrise.",
      "source": "target",
